  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "83",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 83"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "83",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "cl"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Psalm 83",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A song. A psalm of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O God, do not remain silent;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not turn a deaf ear,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not stand aloof, O God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See how your enemies growl,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "how your foes rear their heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With cunning they conspire against your people;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they plot against those you cherish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Come,\" they say, \"let us destroy them as a nation,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that Israel's name is remembered no more.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With one mind they plot together;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they form an alliance against you—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the tents of Edom and the Ishmaelites,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "of Moab and the Hagrites,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byblos, Ammon and Amalek,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Philistia, with the people of Tyre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even Assyria has joined them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to reinforce Lot's descendants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do to them as you did to Midian,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as you did to Sisera and Jabin at the river Kishon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who perished at Endor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and became like dung on the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make their nobles like Oreb and Zeeb,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "all their princes like Zebah and Zalmunna,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who said, \"Let us take possession",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "of the pasturelands of God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make them like tumbleweed, my God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like chaff before the wind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As fire consumes the forest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or a flame sets the mountains ablaze,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so pursue them with your tempest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and terrify them with your storm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cover their faces with shame,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that they will seek your name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "May they ever be ashamed and dismayed;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 83:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "may they perish in disgrace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them know that you, whose name is the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "—",
